  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your item requisition can be for any wand available in your faction’s area. The wands available match the spellcasting services for your faction type. The item’s caster level must be no higher than your associated skill ranks – 3. You can requisition a wand with 5 charges that counts as one-tenth the price or a wand with 10 charges that counts as one-fifth the price.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/faction#toc47\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
